    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "takeaway",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 2036,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "The takeaway\n\nrole and phase decide WHETHER you get a coalition block at\nall. Everything after that only changes the words inside it \u2014\nnever the shape of the prompt.\n\npost_message_availability (Switch B) picks 1 of 4 channel_constraint\nvariants. has_secret_bb (Switch A) narrows that to 2 of them, adds\nsecret_bb_instruction, and then rewrites 8 SECRET-board sentences\nafter the string is already assembled.",
      "originalText": "The takeaway\n\nrole and phase decide WHETHER you get a coalition block at\nall. Everything after that only changes the words inside it \u2014\nnever the shape of the prompt.\n\npost_message_availability (Switch B) picks 1 of 4 channel_constraint\nvariants. has_secret_bb (Switch A) narrows that to 2 of them, adds\nsecret_bb_instruction, and then rewrites 8 SECRET-board sentences\nafter the string is already assembled.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
